        fid                   X0          63:0        UInt64                                FID, value 0xC4000173
        rd                    X1          63:0        Address                               PA of the RD which owns the target
                                                                                            device memory
        vdev_ptr              X2          63:0        Address                               PA of the VDEV
        ipa                   X3          63:0        Address                               IPA at which the memory is mapped in
                                                                                            the target Realm
        level                 X4          63:0        Int64                                 RTT level
